                                <title type="desc">Ferial Psalter (fragmentary): Vespers and Compline for Saturday</title>
                                <rubric>Sabbato ad vesperas ymnus tempore estivali</rubric>
                                <incipit>O lux beata trinitas</incipit>
                                <explicit>et gloriam plebis tue Israel Gloria patris et filio</explicit>
                                <note>
                                    <p>
                                        Among the hymns, listed in <bibl>
                                            <title ref="https://www.manuscripta.se/bibl/107115" type="short">Moberg (1947)</title>
                                            <citedRange unit="page" from="92" to="92"/>
                                            <citedRange unit="page" from="213" to="233"/>
                                        </bibl>, are: </p>
                                    <p>
                                        <locus from="2_1r" to="2_1r" scheme="folios"/>: O lux beata trinitas; Deus creator omnium polique rector; </p>
                                    <p>
                                        <locus from="2_1v" to="2_1v" scheme="folios"/>: Te lucis ante terminum; Iesu salvator saeculi;</p>
                                    <p>
                                        <locus from="2_3v" to="2_3v" scheme="folios"/>: Nunc dimittis (defective).</p>
                                </note>
                            </msItem>
                        </msContents>
